### Phase 1 — Eureka + API Gateway

### Eureka dashboard (open this URL in a browser)
GET http://localhost:8761

### Eureka registered applications (XML is the reliable Eureka payload)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps
Accept: application/xml

### Eureka registered applications (JSON, single app)
GET http://localhost:8761/eureka/apps/API-GATEWAY
Accept: application/json

### Eureka health
GET http://localhost:8761/actuator/health

### Gateway health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Gateway configured routes
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/gateway/routes

### Expected until booking-service exists: 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
GET http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/hotels

### Expected until auth-service exists: 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/health

### Expected until food-service exists: 503 SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE
GET http://localhost:8080/api/food/hotels/1/menu
